aou(a){var s,r="\xc9 a vez do advers\xe1rio (CPU). Observa \u2014 ele joga sozinho.",q="It's your opponent's turn (CPU). Watch \u2014 it plays on its own.",p=this.gag()===B.n||this.gag()===B.o
A:{if("l1_intro"===a){s=p?"Bem-vindo! Vou guiar-te passo a passo \u2014 n\xe3o precisas de saber jogar. Primeiro, como se contam os pontos: cada figura (\xc1s, Rei, Dama, Valete e o 10) vale 2 pontos; o 9 \xe9 um joker e vale 1 ponto. Nesta primeira li\xe7\xe3o vamos jogar para as DAMAS \u2014 s\xe3o os dados verdes (coroa). Clica em \xabSeguinte\xbb.":"Welcome! I'll guide you step by step \u2014 no need to know how to play. First, how scoring works: every figure (Ace, King, Queen, Jack and the 10) is worth 2 points; the 9 is a wildcard worth 1 point. In this first lesson we'll play for QUEENS \u2014 the green dice (crown). Tap \"Next\"."
break A}if("l1_hold"===a){s=p?"Olha para os teus 5 dados. Tens 1 Dama (verde) e 1 nove (9) \u2014 e ambos contam para as Damas. Vamos guard\xe1-los: toca na Dama e no 9 para os segurares (ficam destacados) e depois clica em \xabSegurar e Lan\xe7ar\xbb para voltar a lan\xe7ar s\xf3 os outros 3 dados e tentar apanhar mais Damas.":'Look at your 5 dice. You have 1 Queen (green) and one 9 \u2014 and both count for Queens. Let\'s keep them: tap the Queen and the 9 to hold them (they get highlighted), then tap "Hold & Roll" to re-roll only the other 3 dice and try to get more Queens.'
break A}if("l1_score"===a){s=p?"Boa! Agora tens 3 Damas e um 9: 3\xd72 + 1 = 7 pontos nas Damas. A 1\xaa coluna das Damas precisa de no m\xednimo 7 para abrir. Clica no bot\xe3o das Damas (mostra 7) para marcar e abrir a linha.":"Nice! Now you have 3 Queens and one 9: 3\xd72 + 1 = 7 points in Queens. The 1st Queens column needs at least 7 to open. Tap the Queens button (shows 7) to score and open the line."
break A}if("l1_badluck"===a){s=p?"Depois de marcares, recolheste os 5 dados e lan\xe7aste outra vez \u2014 este \xe9 o 3\xba e \xfaltimo lan\xe7amento do turno. Pouca sorte: neste 3\xba lan\xe7amento n\xe3o conseguiste obter pontos. Vamos ent\xe3o dar a vez ao advers\xe1rio \u2014 clica em \xabTerminar turno\xbb.":'After scoring, you picked up all 5 dice and rolled again \u2014 this is the 3rd and last roll of the turn. Bad luck: this 3rd roll scores nothing. So let\'s hand the turn to your opponent \u2014 tap "End turn".'
break A}if("slice_ai"===a){s=p?r:q
break A}if("l2_score"===a){s=p?"Chegou outra vez a tua vez e sa\xedram logo 3 Damas e um 9 = 7 pontos. Agora marca na 2\xaa coluna das Damas. Repara: essa coluna s\xf3 exige um m\xednimo de 6, mas podes marcar 7 \xe0 mesma \u2014 os n\xfameros da tabela s\xe3o apenas M\xcdNIMOS, podes sempre marcar igual ou mais. Clica no bot\xe3o das Damas.":"It's your turn again and you rolled 3 Queens and a 9 = 7 points right away. Now score into the 2nd Queens column. Note: that column only requires a minimum of 6, but you can still score 7 \u2014 the table numbers are just MINIMUMS, you may always score equal or more. Tap the Queens button."
break A}if("ai_turn"===a){s=p?r:q
break A}if("ai_scored"===a){s=p?"O advers\xe1rio marcou alguns pontos nesta jogada. A seguir \xe9 a tua vez.":"Your opponent scored some points this turn. You're up next."
break A}if("l2_fullen"===a){s=p?"Marcaste e voltaste a lan\xe7ar os 5 dados. Como n\xe3o seguraste nenhum, isto \xe9 um lan\xe7amento \xabde m\xe3o\xbb \u2014 e saiu um FULLEN (3 dados iguais + 2 iguais: 3 Ases e 2 Reis)! Um fullen vale 15, mas \xabde m\xe3o\xbb vale o DOBRO = 30. Clica no bot\xe3o \xabFullen\xbb para marcar.":'You scored and rolled all 5 dice again. Since you held none, this is a "from hand" roll \u2014 and you got a FULL HOUSE (3 of a kind + 2 of a kind: 3 Aces and 2 Kings)! A full house is worth 15, but "from hand" it is DOUBLE = 30. Tap the "Full house" button to score.'
break A}if("l2_poker"===a){s=p?"Outra vez de m\xe3o \u2014 e saiu um POKER: 4 dados iguais (4 Reis)! O poker s\xf3 conta quando \xe9 de m\xe3o e vale 100 pontos, a melhor jogada. Clica no bot\xe3o \xabPoker\xbb. (Podias marcar os Reis como figura, mas o Poker vale muito mais!)":'From hand again \u2014 and you got a POKER: 4 of a kind (4 Kings)! Poker only counts from hand and is worth 100 points, the best play. Tap the "Poker" button. (You could score Kings as a figure, but Poker is worth far more!)'
break A}if("l3_hold2"===a){s=p?"Nem sempre sai tudo \xe0 primeira \u2014 por isso tens 3 lan\xe7amentos. Agora vamos marcar os REIS. Sa\xedram-te 2 Reis: toca nos dois Reis para os segurares e clica \xabSegurar e Lan\xe7ar\xbb para tentar apanhar mais.":"You don't always get it on the first try \u2014 that's why you have 3 rolls. Now let's score KINGS. You got 2 Kings: tap both Kings to hold them and tap \"Hold & Roll\" to try for more."
break A}if("l3_hold3"===a){s=p?"Boa, j\xe1 tens 3 Reis! Segura os 3 Reis e lan\xe7a outra vez para tentar o 4\xba.":"Nice, you have 3 Kings! Hold all 3 Kings and roll again to try for the 4th."
break A}if("l3_score"===a){s=p?"Perfeito: 4 Reis! 4\xd72 = 8 pontos. Clica no bot\xe3o dos Reis para marcar e abrir a linha dos Reis.":"Perfect: 4 Kings! 4\xd72 = 8 points. Tap the Kings button to score and open the Kings line."
break A}if("l4_hold"===a){s=p?"Agora uma SEQU\xcaNCIA. A sequ\xeancia grande \xe9 \xc1s, Rei, Dama, Valete e 10 \u2014 os 5 valores, e a ORDEM N\xc3O IMPORTA. Olha: j\xe1 tens o \xc1s, o Rei, a Dama e o 10. S\xf3 te falta o Valete! Segura esses 4 dados (sim, inclui o 10) e relan\xe7a s\xf3 o \xfaltimo para tentar o Valete.":"Now a SEQUENCE. The big straight is Ace, King, Queen, Jack and 10 \u2014 the 5 values, and the ORDER DOES NOT MATTER. Look: you already have the Ace, King, Queen and the 10. You only need the Jack! Hold those 4 dice (yes, including the 10) and re-roll just the last one for the Jack."
break A}if("l4_again"===a){s=p?"N\xe3o calhou o Valete \u2014 sem problema, tens 3 lan\xe7amentos. Segura outra vez o \xc1s, o Rei, a Dama e o 10, e relan\xe7a o \xfaltimo dado.":"No Jack yet \u2014 no problem, you have 3 rolls. Hold the Ace, King, Queen and 10 again, and re-roll the last die."
break A}if("l4_score"===a){s=p?"Conseguiste a sequ\xeancia grande (\xc1s-Rei-Dama-Valete-10)! Vale 30 pontos. Repara que N\xc3O foi \xabde m\xe3o\xbb (seguraste dados) \u2014 se tivesse sa\xeddo tudo de uma vez valeria o dobro, 60. As combina\xe7\xf5es especiais (sequ\xeancias, fullen, poker) somam-se \xe0 parte na tabela. Clica no bot\xe3o \xabSequ\xeancia\xbb.":'You made the big straight (Ace-King-Queen-Jack-10)! It is worth 30 points. Note it was NOT "from hand" (you held dice) \u2014 if it had all come in one roll it would be double, 60. Special combos (sequences, full house, poker) are added separately on the table. Tap the "Sequence" button.'
break A}if("end_jump"===a){s=p?"J\xe1 aprendeste o essencial: marcar figuras, usar os 3 lan\xe7amentos, o fullen, o poker e as sequ\xeancias. Vamos saltar para o fim de um jogo \u2014 est\xe1s a ganhar e s\xf3 falta uma jogada para fechares. Clica em \xabSeguinte\xbb.":"You've learned the essentials: scoring figures, using the 3 rolls, the full house, poker and sequences. Let's jump to the end of a game \u2014 you're winning and one move away from closing it. Tap \"Next\"."
break A}if("end_score"===a){s=p?"Esta \xe9 a jogada que fecha o jogo! A tua linha dos 10 est\xe1 quase completa e sa\xedram tr\xeas 10 e dois 9 = 8 pontos, que chega para a \xfaltima coluna. Clica no bot\xe3o dos 10 para marcar, fechar a linha e GANHAR o jogo!":"This is the move that closes the game! Your Tens line is almost complete and you rolled three 10s and two 9s = 8 points, enough for the last column. Tap the Tens button to score, close the line and WIN the game!"
break A}s=""
break A}return s},
